   "id": "12152:463",
   "text": "A qualified writer turns out clear, polished copy that gets proofread before you see it. Best for captions, emails, blog posts and product pages, where the brief is simple and the topic is familiar. Expect a clean draft in your voice."
  },
  {
   "id": "12152:481",
   "text": "A senior writer plus an extra round of editing. Best for website pages, articles and scripts, where the tone has to land and the words need to convince. A fresh editor goes through it cold and cuts anything that's just filler."
  },
  {
   "id": "12152:499",
   "text": "Your topic's strongest writer, backed by real research. Best for e-books, white papers and technical guides, where readers fact check everything. Every claim gets a source and two rounds of checks before the draft lands in your account."
